# Cursor Rules — Systems Engineering Portfolio

## Build Commands
```bash
# Rust check all crates except Linux-only
cargo check --workspace --all-features --exclude platform-nodes --exclude container-engine

# Rust tests
cargo test --workspace --all-features --exclude platform-nodes --exclude container-engine

# Frontend
cd ui-control-center && npm run build
cd ui-control-center && npm test
```

## Rules
- Always `cargo fmt` before committing
- Never use unwrap/expect/panic in Rust `src/`
- Never add GPL/AGPL crates (denied by deny.toml)
- New Rust crates: edition 2021, MIT license, description field
- New UI components: "use client", TypeScript, Tailwind v4 classes
- Frontend simulated data: useState + setInterval pattern
